SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with Shanté
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Music by Shanté\, Music Set by DJ Shell Heart\, Drag Stor
 ytime with Per Sia\, Mini House Making\, Nexus Black Art Week Panel Discus
 sion\, and Gallery Chats This Friday Night at OMCA\, Oakland singer-songwr
 iter Shanté brings her soulful sound to the Garden Stage with a powerful 
 live performance. Blending smooth R&B\, heartfelt storytelling\, and uplif
 ting messages of resilience\, faith\, and self-discovery\, the East Oaklan
 d artist delivers an intimate yet energetic set that invites audiences to 
 sing along\, reflect\, and leave inspired.\nhttps://museumca.org/event/fri
 day-nights-at-omca-with-shante/\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.ci
 ty/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-shante/
